        "steam_appid": 3859420,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859420/extras/4f962136e57f4dc1041a4d5bc1512697.avif?t=1766430536\" width=219 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a daredevil, a record-setter, a realm racer!</strong> Equipped with an engine that never rests, you’ll blast through eras and biomes on unconventional racetracks—setting records and breaking them all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realm Racer</i> is an arcade racing game built around a dense collection of levels, each challenging you to find the perfect line and achieve the highest score possible. Complexity and difficulty rise steadily, and stopping is never an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race through diverse realms and unique hand-crafted tracks in Realm Racing mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins and aim for perfect times to earn shiny medals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set records and unlock new vehicles by earning achievements and amassing collectibles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove your ultimate skill in multiple difficult Cups within Grand Prix mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own challenge with the custom Cup</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859420/extras/4f962136e57f4dc1041a4d5bc1512697.avif?t=1766430536\" width=219 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a daredevil, a record-setter, a realm racer!</strong> Equipped with an engine that never rests, you’ll blast through eras and biomes on unconventional racetracks—setting records and breaking them all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Realm Racer</i> is an arcade racing game built around a dense collection of levels, each challenging you to find the perfect line and achieve the highest score possible. Complexity and difficulty rise steadily, and stopping is never an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race through diverse realms and unique hand-crafted tracks in Realm Racing mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect coins and aim for perfect times to earn shiny medals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set records and unlock new vehicles by earning achievements and amassing collectibles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prove your ultimate skill in multiple difficult Cups within Grand Prix mode</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own challenge with the custom Cup</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Speed through time and space and set records in Realm Racer. Powered by an engine that never stops, your only limits are the height of your ambition—and the many physical obstacles you might crash into along the way. Prove your skill and rise to become a champion!",
